# ================= Reversal Strategy dashboard (Vite) =================
# The dashboard talks only to its own backend origin: in dev via the Vite proxy
# (see vite.config.ts), in prod same-origin behind the reverse proxy. Human login
# is proxied through the Swing backend's /api/auth/login, so the browser never
# needs the Gateway's address. There are currently no build-time vars to set.
